{"id":"torrey:stars-the","source":"torrey","name":"Stars, The","slug":"stars-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Infinite in number — Ge 15:5; Jer 33:2.","refs":[["Gen",15,5,15,5],["Jer",33,2,33,2]]},{"text":"Created. — Ge 1:16; Ps 8:3; 148:5.","refs":[["Gen",1,16,1,16],["Ps",8,3,8,3],["Ps",148,5,148,5]]},{"text":"Set, in the firmament of heaven. — Ge 1:17.","refs":[["Gen",1,17,1,17]]},{"text":"Appointed to give light by night. — Ge 1:16,14; Ps 136:9; Jer 31:35.","refs":[["Gen",1,16,1,16],["Gen",1,14,1,14],["Ps",136,9,136,9],["Jer",31,35,31,35]]},{"text":"Numbers and names. — Ps 147:4.","refs":[["Ps",147,4,147,4]]},{"text":"Established, for ever. — Ps 148:3,6; Jer 31:36.","refs":[["Ps",148,3,148,3],["Ps",148,6,148,6],["Jer",31,36,31,36]]},{"text":"Obscures. — Job 9:7.","refs":[["Job",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"Revolve in fixed orbits — Jdj 5:20.","refs":[["Judg",5,20,5,20]]},{"text":"Shine in the firmament of heaven — Da 12:3.","refs":[["Dan",12,3,12,3]]},{"text":"Appear of different magnitudes — 1Co 15:41.","refs":[["1Cor",15,41,15,41]]},{"text":"Appear after sunset — Ne 4:21; Job 3:9.","refs":[["Neh",4,21,4,21],["Job",3,9,3,9]]},{"text":"The host of heaven. — De 17:3; Jer 33:22.","refs":[["Deut",17,3,17,3],["Jer",33,22,33,22]]},{"text":"Stars of light. — Ps 148:3.","refs":[["Ps",148,3,148,3]]},{"text":"Stars of heaven. — Isa 13:10.","refs":[["Isa",13,10,13,10]]},{"text":"When grouped together called constellations — 2Ki 23:5; Isa 13:10.","refs":[["2Kgs",23,5,23,5],["Isa",13,10,13,10]]},{"text":"Exhibit the greatness of God’s power — Ps 8:3; Isa 40:26.","refs":[["Ps",8,3,8,3],["Isa",40,26,40,26]]},{"text":"Made to praise God — Ps 148:3.","refs":[["Ps",148,3,148,3]]},{"text":"Impure in the sight of God — Job 25:5.","refs":[["Job",25,5,25,5]]},{"text":"Morning star. — Re 2:28.","refs":[["Rev",2,28,2,28]]},{"text":"Arcturus. — Job 9:9; 38:32.","refs":[["Job",9,9,9,9],["Job",38,32,38,32]]},{"text":"Pleiades. — Job 9:9; 38:31; Am 5:8.","refs":[["Job",9,9,9,9],["Job",38,31,38,31],["Amos",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"Orion. — Job 9:9; 38:31; Am 5:8.","refs":[["Job",9,9,9,9],["Job",38,31,38,31],["Amos",5,8,5,8]]},{"text":"Mazzaroth. — Job 38:32.","refs":[["Job",38,32,38,32]]},{"text":"One of extraordinary brightness appeared at Christ’s birth — Mt 2:2,9.","refs":[["Matt",2,2,2,2],["Matt",2,9,2,9]]},{"text":"Idolaters worshipped — Jer 8:2; 19:13.","refs":[["Jer",8,2,8,2],["Jer",19,13,19,13]]},{"text":"The Israelites forbidden to worship — De 4:19; 17:2-4.","refs":[["Deut",4,19,4,19],["Deut",17,2,17,4]]},{"text":"Punishment for worshipping — De 17:5-7.","refs":[["Deut",17,5,17,7]]},{"text":"False gods frequently worshipped under the representation of — Am 5:26; Ac 7:43.","refs":[["Amos",5,26,5,26],["Acts",7,43,7,43]]},{"text":"Astrology and star-gazing practised by the Babylonians — Isa 47:13.","refs":[["Isa",47,13,47,13]]},{"text":"Use of, in navigation, alluded to — Ac 27:20.","refs":[["Acts",27,20,27,20]]},{"text":"Of Christ. — Nu 24:17.","refs":[["Num",24,17,24,17]]},{"text":"Of angels. — Job 38:7.","refs":[["Job",38,7,38,7]]},{"text":"Of ministers. — Re 1:16,20; 2:1.","refs":[["Rev",1,16,1,16],["Rev",1,20,1,20],["Rev",2,1,2,1]]},{"text":"Of princes and subordinate governors. — Da 8:10; Re 8:12.","refs":[["Dan",8,10,8,10],["Rev",8,12,8,12]]},{"text":"(Bright and morning star,) of Christ. — Re 22:16.","refs":[["Rev",22,16,22,16]]},{"text":"(Morning star,) of glory to be given to faithful saints. — Re 2:28.","refs":[["Rev",2,28,2,28]]},{"text":"(Shining of,) of the reward of faithful ministers. — Da 12:3.","refs":[["Dan",12,3,12,3]]},{"text":"(Withdrawing their light,) of severe judgments. — Isa 13:10; Eze 32:7; Joe 2:10; 3:15.","refs":[["Isa",13,10,13,10],["Ezek",32,7,32,7],["Joel",2,10,2,10],["Joel",3,15,3,15]]},{"text":"(Setting the nest amongst,) of pride and carnal security. — Ob 1:4.","refs":[["Obad",1,4,1,4]]},{"text":"(Wandering,) of false teachers. — Jude 1:13.","refs":[["Jude",1,13,1,13]]}],"refCount":67}
